  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform thin metal plate of mass $10 \\mathrm{~kg}$ with dimensions is shown. The ratio of $\\mathrm{x}$ and $\\mathrm{y}$ coordinates of center of mass of plate in $\\frac{n}{9}$. The value of $n$ is ________\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/gGngAAhJs-UjuVfzAbI13GvZEOYNmmzwnibFrxIDQRM.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{m}_1=\\sigma \\times 5=10 \\mathrm{Kg}$\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/X6yhI2C1sUOB20zb3J2rRmbN8g2yWEPemeMSzZ0169w.original.fullsize.png\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/67FKEZ98mDzR61vgR-rsM71JMXUzMgAPQEIykVM6y2k.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{m}_1 \\mathrm{x}_1+\\mathrm{m}_2 \\mathrm{x}_2=\\mathrm{m}_3 \\mathrm{x}_3 \\\\ & 10 \\mathrm{x}_1+2(1.5)=12(1.5) \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{x}_1=1.5 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\ & \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{m}_1 \\mathrm{y}_1+\\mathrm{m}_2 \\mathrm{y}_2=\\mathrm{m}_3 \\mathrm{y}_3 \\\\ & 10 \\mathrm{y}_1+2(1.5)=12 \\times 1 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm{y}_1=0.9 \\mathrm{~cm} \\\\ & \\frac{\\mathrm{x}_1}{\\mathrm{y}_1}=\\frac{1.5}{0.9}=\\frac{15}{9} \\\\ & \\mathrm{n}=15\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
